{"id":"604448","name":"红枣杂粮窝窝头","author":"筠旸JY","authorId":"7345450","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/604448/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"稻米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黑米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黑米少许。","img":"images/604448/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入破壁机的粉碎杯中。","img":"images/604448/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"按粉碎键，打成粉。","img":"images/604448/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"小米适量，放入破壁机里面。","img":"images/604448/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"打成粉状。","img":"images/604448/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"稻米也同样操作。","img":"images/604448/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"三种面粉放一起。","img":"images/604448/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"混合均匀。","img":"images/604448/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"红枣洗净，清水一小碗。","img":"images/604448/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"面粉中分次倒入适量清水，用筷子搅拌成絮状。","img":"images/604448/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入红枣混合在一起。","img":"images/604448/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"分成若干份，取一份团成圆形。","img":"images/604448/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"双手配合，四指转动，拇指捏空。","img":"images/604448/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"全部做好所有的窝头，放入蒸锅里面，垫上油纸不容易粘锅，也免去了清洗的麻烦。","img":"images/604448/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"大火上汽后蒸二十分钟即可关火。","img":"images/604448/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"开锅看看。","img":"images/604448/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图！","img":"images/604448/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图！","img":"images/604448/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品图！","img":"images/604448/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}